, and I had plenty of those.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_juveniledays_02_e_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"ein","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_juveniledays_02_e_14","text":"But somewhere along the line, I started feeling lonely.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_juveniledays_02_e_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"ein","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_juveniledays_02_e_15","text":"That's when it hit me that I don't have any real friends.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_juveniledays_02_e_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"rupee","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_juveniledays_02_e_16","text":"I see.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_juveniledays_02_e_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"rupee","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_juveniledays_02_e_17","text":"Well, to me,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_juveniledays_02_e_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"rupee","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_juveniledays_02_e_18","text":"a friend is someone I can count on when I'm feeling down, someone who shares in my joy and laughter when I'm happy,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_juveniledays_02_e_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"rupee","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_juveniledays_02_e_19","text":"and someone I can be completely myself around, where I don't have to hide any part of who I am.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image"