en, you must have considered loads of people to be your friends.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_juveniledays_02_e_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"rupee","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_juveniledays_02_e_33","text":"But things have clearly changed now.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_juveniledays_02_e_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"rupee","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_juveniledays_02_e_34","text":"That means you've started to desire deeper and more meaningful relationships.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_juveniledays_02_e_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"ein","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_juveniledays_02_e_35","text":"So... what a friend means to me?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_juveniledays_02_e_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"rupee","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_juveniledays_02_e_36","text":"That's right!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_juveniledays_02_e_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"rupee","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_juveniledays_02_e_37","text":"Let's not stress over it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_juveniledays_02_e_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"rupee","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_juveniledays_02_e_38","text":"How about we keep it nice and simple?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_juveniledays_02_e_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"rupee","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_juveniledays_02_e_39","text":"Right now, you're looking for someone to go to Rushae Fashion Week with, right?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_juveniledays_02_e_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"rupee","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_juveniledays_02_e_40","text":"Wouldn't you say those with whom you want to share the things you love are your friends?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_juveniledays_02_e_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"ein","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_juveniledays_02_e_41","text":"...!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_juveniledays_02_e_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"ein","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_juveniledays_02_e_42","text":"You're right.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_juveniledays_02_e_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"ein","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_juveniledays_02_e_43","text":"Actually, I wouldn't mind going to the Fashion Week alone.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_juveniledays_02_e_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"ein","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_juveniledays_02_e_44","text":"But as soon as the dates were out, I immediately thought about going with Zwei and Rei.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_juveniledays_02_e_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"ein","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_juveniledays_02_e_45","text":"Zwei's